# Changelog

All notable changes to `{{packageName}}` follow [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/) and [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).

## [1.0.0] — {{date}}

### Added

- Initial release.
- {{studlyName}} icon set integrated with the Ichava ecosystem.
- `<x-{{kebabName}}-icons-icon>` Blade component, plus support for the generic `<x-ichava::icon>` form.
- `ichava:update-{{kebabName}}-icons` Artisan command for refreshing the collection from source.
